      "topLeftY": 227,
      "bottomRightX": 724,
      "bottomRightY": 264,
      "content": "The length of the chunk data section varies depending on the number of activated chunks, but the receiver can always expect the chunk data section to fit within the maximum size of PayloadSize.",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
